          deckDescription: 'One standard 52-card deck consisting of four suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs), each with thirteen ranks from ace down to two. No jokers; used for Briscola a 151 where the first partnership to reach 151 points (from tricks and card points) wins.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs). Trump is determined by the turned card; follow suit when able. Point values (ace 11, three 10, king 4, queen 3, jack 2; others zero) are counted from captured cards.',
          rankDescription: 'Thirteen ranks per suit; point values: ace 11, three 10, king 4, queen 3, jack 2, others zero. Trick order follows Briscola (trump beats plain; within suit, higher card wins). The target is 151 points.',
